<section xml:id="bst_summary">
  <title>Summary</title>
  <p>In this chapter we have looked at binary search trees. More specifically, we examined:</p>
  <p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <p>A binary search tree for implementing the map ADT.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>A balanced binary search tree (AVL tree) for implementing the map ADT.</p>
      </li>
